# The Go package alongside this chart describes its values as typed structs; see
# component.go and the catalogs package. Helm never reads these files - it only
# looks at Chart.yaml, values.yaml, templates/, charts/ and crds/ - but they would
# otherwise be swept into a `helm package` tarball.
*.go
# Source of the compute-ssh launcher image the chart's init container runs.
compute-ssh/
